# DSH Desktop: 给 Electron 加 --force-renderer-accessibility

## 改的文件
1. /home/.../.pkm/20_Projects/P_20260422_桌面助手/self-dev/dshdesktop
   (bash 启动脚本)
   备份: .bak.20260924-1757

2. /home/.../.pkm/20_Projects/P_20260422_桌面助手/dsh-plugin-desktop/lib/bin.js
   (Electron launcher)
   备份: .bak.20260924-1757

## 改动 1: dshdesktop 脚本
在 CDP 环境块后追加:
```bash
# AT-SPI 启用 — 让 Electron renderer 进程向 accessibility bus 注册自己
if [[ "${ELECTRON_FORCE_RENDERER_ACCESSIBILITY:-1}" == "1" ]]; then
  export ELECTRON_FORCE_RENDERER_ACCESSIBILITY=1
  echo "[$SCRIPT_NAME] Electron renderer accessibility enabled (--force-renderer-accessibility)"
else
  unset ELECTRON_FORCE_RENDERER_ACCESSIBILITY
  echo "[$SCRIPT_NAME] Electron renderer accessibility disabled"
fi
```

## 改动 2: bin.js
在 ELECTRON_REMOTE_DEBUGGING 块后追加:
```js
if (process.env.ELECTRON_FORCE_RENDERER_ACCESSIBILITY === "1") {
    args.push("--force-renderer-accessibility");
    process.stderr.write(`${DESKTOP_PACKAGE_NAME}: --force-renderer-accessibility enabled (Electron renderer processes will register with AT-SPI)\n`);
}
```

## 启动链
1. self-dev/dshdesktop  → export ELECTRON_FORCE_RENDERER_ACCESSIBILITY=1
2. corepack yarn start     → dsh-plugin-desktop/lib/bin.js
3. bin.js 读 env           → args.push("--force-renderer-accessibility")
4. spawn(electron, args)   → Electron renderer 带 flag 启动
5. Electron Chromium 自动向 AT-SPI bus 注册 renderer 进程

